                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great game! Very polished and will keep you coming back for more! It's a solid dual stick shooter, with it's main draw being that you chase down either your previous high score or aim to have the best world rank.\n\nIt has very simple controls and mechanics, but also has plenty of depth in how you use your tools to maintain your combo or streak to really rack up your score.\n\nGreat music to listen to while you blast away at your high score. Always keeps you pumped!\n\nIt's an easy purchase at just under $5. You will constantly improve if you give it time. I've put in just over 100hrs into the game total between the Steam and Nintendo Switch edition. Definitely recommended!",
